    "Committed baseline of the KNOWN-RED test suite at merge 27ef0be / ab994f9.",
    "",
    "WHY THIS FILE EXISTS. EPIC G7 (eiams-frontend-vi65.14) was chartered with the",
    "acceptance criterion 'All 135 MSW-dependent test suites still pass'. That",
    "criterion is UNSATISFIABLE as written: the suite is already red at HEAD, for a",
    "reason unrelated to G7. Per the ratified decision (Q1 option b), G7's contract",
    "is instead a NO-REGRESSION contract: G7 must change no test outcome at all.",
    "",
    "THE RED IS NOT G7's FAULT. Root cause is eiams-frontend-9uuf (P0, open):",
    "createCatalogService/createInventoryService/createOrganizationService/",
    "createCounterpartLookupService/createWarehouseService default their lazy",
    "singleton to `{} as any`, and no production code constructs a real",
    "ApiTransport, so the first list call throws",
    "`TypeError: transport.requestPage is not a function`. `main` appears green",
    "only because its own tests cast an AxiosInstance to ApiTransport, which",
    "satisfies the type and defeats the check.",
    "",
    "HOW TO USE. `pnpm run test:baseline` re-runs the suite and fails if ANY test",
    "file's outcome differs from this list. Passing is not a claim that the suite",
    "is green - it is a claim that G7 changed nothing. When 9uuf lands and the",
    "suite goes green, regenerate deliberately with `pnpm run test:baseline --accept`",
    "and record the reason in the bead; never regenerate to silence a new failure.",
    "",
    "COUNTS are asserted by src/test/red-suite-baseline.test.ts so this file",
    "cannot be edited down to an empty list and pass vacuously."
